<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>

<div class="bg-navy py-5 text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #172554 0%, #1e3a8a 100%);">
  <div class="container py-3">
    <div class="max-w-700">
      <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark fw-bold mb-2 text-uppercase">About The Platform</span>
      <h1 class="display-5 fw-extrabold text-white mb-2">Campus Ride – Sherubtse College</h1>
      <p class="lead text-light text-opacity-90">
        Kanglung, Trashigang, Bhutan • Empowering the academic community with safe, organized, and reliable transit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row g-5">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <h3 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-3">Project Overview & Objectives</h3>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Campus Ride</strong> is an institutional web-based Campus Transport Booking System tailored specifically for <strong>Sherubtse College</strong>, Royal University of Bhutan. The rugged mountainous terrain of eastern Bhutan and the dispersion of campus facilities create unique transportation requirements for both resident students and faculty members.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
        The core objective is to replace informal, chaotic coordination with a centralized, predictable, and fair platform that caters to three key transport pillars:
      </p>

      <div class="row g-3 my-3">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card p-3 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-primary mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-person-walking-luggage me-1"></i> Weekday Rides</h6>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Hostel to classroom connection on weekdays with a guaranteed fixed fare of Nu. 100.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card p-3 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-warning mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-taxi me-1"></i> Campus Taxis</h6>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">On-demand and scheduled point-to-point transit with transparent whole-hire or shared fare splitting.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card p-3 border-0 shadow-sm rounded-3 bg-light h-100">
            <h6 class="fw-bold text-info mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-bus me-1"></i> College Buses</h6>
            <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Organized institutional booking for departmental field visits and class trips.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4 class="fw-bold text-navy mt-4 mb-3">Safety & Driver Verification</h4>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
        To uphold passenger safety, drivers on Campus Ride must undergo administrative verification by the College Transport Office before receiving ride authorizations. This guarantees that all operating drivers possess valid commercial driving licenses, appropriate vehicle capacity, and college clearance.
      </p>

      <h4 class="fw-bold text-navy mt-4 mb-3">Cash-Based Payment Assurance</h4>
      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
        Recognizing local banking and student preferences, Campus Ride supports an accountable cash payment workflow. Fares are clearly shown before booking. Upon trip completion, passengers pay cash directly to the driver, who records the payment in the system. Official college-sponsored trips can be marked as Waived by administrators.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-4">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 bg-light mb-4">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-navy mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns text-primary me-2"></i> Institutional Profile</h5>
        <ul class="list-unstyled small text-muted mb-0">
          <li class="py-2 border-bottom"><strong>Institution:</strong> Sherubtse College</li>
          <li class="py-2 border-bottom"><strong>Affiliation:</strong> Royal University of Bhutan</li>
          <li class="py-2 border-bottom"><strong>Location:</strong> Kanglung, Trashigang</li>
          <li class="py-2 border-bottom"><strong>Operating Hours:</strong> 24/7 Booking Portal</li>
          <li class="py-2"><strong>Payment Method:</strong> Cash on completion / Admin Waived</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 text-white" style="background-color: var(--dark-navy);">
        <h5 class="fw-bold text-warning mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone me-2"></i> Transport Office</h5>
        <p class="small text-light text-opacity-80 mb-3">For emergency transit assistance or departmental bus reservation queries:</p>
        <div class="small mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-warning me-2"></i> +975-17111000</div>
        <div class="small"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-warning me-2"></i> transport@sherubtse.edu.bt</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
